reckon 0
pack zorgtoeslag
use std.money

-- Case data for cases.yaml. People and amounts are invented.

fact Household
  | id    | claimant |
  | h-ann | ann      |
  | h-bob | bob      |
  | h-dex | dex      |
  | h-eve | eve      |
  | h-fay | fay      |
  | h-gus | gus      |
  | h-hal | hal      |
  | h-ivy | ivy      |

fact Person
  | id  | birth_date | insured_from            | insured_until | household |
  | ann | 1990-05-01 | 2020-01-01              | n/a           | h-ann     |
  | bob | 1985-03-10 | 2015-01-01              | n/a           | h-bob     |
  | cas | 1987-07-20 | 2015-01-01              | n/a           | h-bob     |
  | dex | 2008-02-29 | 2026-03-01              | n/a           | h-dex     |
  | eve | 1970-01-01 | n/a                     | n/a           | h-eve     |
  | fay | 1980-11-11 | 2010-01-01              | n/a           | h-fay     |
  | gus | 1992-02-02 | 2018-01-01              | n/a           | h-gus     |
  | hal | 2000-06-06 | 2019-01-01              | n/a           | h-hal     |
  | ivy | 1995-09-09 | unknown no_cover_report | n/a           | h-ivy     |

-- Income per calendar year: a fact version per year (Reckon v0 §5a rule 5).
